[E0322] Error: no loop around this one is called `nowhere`
    ╭─[ err/157_loop_labels/main.wip:13:15 ]
    │
 13 │         break nowhere
    │               ───┬───  
    │                  ╰───── unknown loop
    │ 
    │ Note: `break name` leaves the loop of that name, which is written `name: while …` or `name: for …`
────╯
[E0322] Error: `break` outside a loop
    ╭─[ err/157_loop_labels/main.wip:16:5 ]
    │
 16 │     break away
    │     ─────┬────  
    │          ╰────── not inside `while` or `for`
    │ 
    │ Note: `break` leaves the innermost loop, and `continue` starts its next pass
────╯
